## Taking it over

**With basstler**, from a checkout of this repository whose personal-notes branch is set
up:

```bash
basstler plan-handover import
```

That finds this pull request, saves every plan, progress note and repository rule onto
your personal-notes branch, then closes it. With several handovers open, name this one
with `--pull-request`,
or take them all over with `--all`. Start an item with `/plan-item-kickoff <plan-id> <item-id>`
and continue one that is underway with `/plan-item-resolve <plan-id> <item-id>`.

**Without basstler**, open [`{{ location.PULL_REQUEST_DIRECTORY }}/{{ location.GUIDE }}`]({{ guide_url }}): it
describes every item and how to work it. Close this pull request once you have read it.

