| Path | What it is |
| --- | --- |
| `{{ location.PULL_REQUEST_DIRECTORY }}/{{ location.GUIDE }}` | The guide to every item: state, branch, pull request, dependencies, notes and blockers. |
| `{{ location.PULL_REQUEST_DIRECTORY }}/{{ location.PLANS }}/` | Each plan's `plan.yaml` and standing rules. |
| `{{ location.PULL_REQUEST_DIRECTORY }}/{{ location.PULL_REQUEST_PROGRESS }}/` | The progress note of every item's branch that has one. |
{% if handover.repository_rules.rules %}
| `{{ location.PULL_REQUEST_DIRECTORY }}/{{ location.REPOSITORY_RULES }}` | The rules every plan of the repository follows. |
{% endif %}

The sessions that started these items are left out: only the person who ran a session can
open it.
